## 8. Summary

| Feature | Goals | Debt (Cash) | Debt (Existing) |
|---------|-------|------------|-----------------|
| **Core Concept** | Forward savings projects with line-item costs | Cash borrowed (affects account balance) | Existing obligations or property (no account impact) |
| **Main Collections** | `goals/{goalId}`, `goals/{goalId}/lineItems/{id}` | `debts/{debtId}`, `debts/{debtId}/repayments/{id}` (with debtType="cash") | Same collection, debtType="existing" |
| **Account Impact** | Creates expense when line item marked complete | Repayment creates transaction, debits account | Repayment logs progress, no account debit (unless manually linked) |
| **Key Checks** | Frozen funds available per line item | Balance remaining, priority, next payment date | Balance remaining, priority, next payment date |
| **Primary UI** | Goals tab (list + detail + create) | Debt tab (dashboard + detail + create) with type badges |
| **Charts** | Goal progress bar (linear) | Debt trend line (monthly balance), priority breakdown, optional type breakdown |
| **Transactions** | Creates expense when line item marked complete | Always creates transaction for cash debt; optional for existing debt |
| **Soft Delete** | `goal.archived: boolean` | `debt.archivedAt: timestamp` (null if active) |